Package: nrouter
Type: Package
Title: OpenAI-Compatible SDK for the nRouter LLM Gateway
Version: 3.0.0
Authors@R: person("nRouter", email = "hello@nrouter.ai", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: nRouter [aut, cre]
Maintainer: nRouter <hello@nrouter.ai>
Description: A client for the nRouter LLM gateway (<https://nrouter.ai>), an
    OpenAI-compatible API giving one key access to models across six provider
    clouds. No official OpenAI SDK exists for R, so this package calls the HTTP
    API directly via 'httr'. Gateway refusals are raised as classed conditions,
    and per-request cost and token metadata are returned alongside every
    response.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://nrouter.ai, https://github.com/nRouterAI/nrouter-sdk
BugReports: https://github.com/nRouterAI/nrouter-sdk/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports:
    curl,
    httr,
    jsonlite
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    webfakes
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
